          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi wonke amakhosi asenyakatho, kude naseduze, omunye nomunye, futhi yonke imibuso yezwe esemhlabeni, nenkosi yaseSesaki iyophuza emva kwabo.",
