          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho wothi kubo: Usho kanje uJehova Sebawoti, uNkulunkulu ka-Israyeli; Phuzani, nidakwe, nikhafule niwe, ningabe nisasukuma ngenxa yenkemba engiyoyithumela phakathi kwenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
